			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710995501,
					"content": "這樣就好解決了，皆大歡喜。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995502,
						710995508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雲堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710995502,
					"content": "關於若心…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995503
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710995503,
					"content": "其實我的確是剛從輕策莊回來，也的確是去探望若心前輩了，前輩說的話也是真的，只是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雲堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710995504,
					"content": "只是？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995505
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710995505,
					"content": "噓！只是我啊，沒說全。前輩那一整句話是：",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雲堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710995506,
					"content": "「二哥總愛跟自己過不去，摳摳搜搜的，周圍人也跟著他受罪，聽著讓人難過。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雲堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710995507,
					"content": "雖然是大實話，但要是全說了，二爺該不開心了，我才只說了半截。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "雲堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710995508,
					"content": "我先坐會。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995509
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710995509,
					"content": "好啊，我第二喜歡的就是等個好天氣，來茶館裡坐著。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雲堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710995510,
					"content": "劉蘇先生不開講的時候，就坐在這裡聽聽市聲，也很舒心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雲堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710995511,
					"content": "第一喜歡的呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995512
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710995512,
					"content": "當然是登臺唱戲呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雲堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710995513,
					"content": "#我確實還有很多話想跟{F#妳}{M#你}聊聊，但你看，劉蘇先生還在一邊等著你拿來木板修戲臺呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "雲堇"
				}
			]
